<title>USA: Emerging Markets NAV rises to $13.39/shr.</title>
<headline>Emerging Markets NAV rises to $13.39/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Emerging Markets Infrastructure Fund Inc, a closed-end non-diversified management investment company, said on Wednesday its net asset value as of November 30 was $13.39 per share, compared to $11.60 by November 30, 1995.</p>
<p>The fund began operations on December 29, 1993 with a net asset value of $13.89 per share, it said.</p>
<p>Both the November 30, 1996 and the November 30, 1995 net asset values were based on 16.1 million shares outstanding, it said.</p>
